{{also|Sommer}}
==Afrikaans==

===Interjection===
'''sommer''' (Usage: ''[[South African]]'')

# Close to [[just because]]; answer to questions (especially "Why" questions) that you do not want to answer or don't have a specific answer for.
#:''Q:"Why do I have to go to school?" A:"'''Sommer'''." i.e. just because you have to''
# For no particular reason.

{{rfc}}

